              "value": "Hurl Net"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The grippli is wielding a net in two hands\n\nThe grippli makes a ranged Strike (with a +9 modifier) against a Medium or smaller creature within 20 feet. On a hit, the target is flat-footed and takes a \u201310-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds. On a critical hit, the creature is restrained instead. The DC to Escape the net is 16. A creature adjacent to the target can Interact with the net to remove it."
